{"about_the_game":"Use YoloMouse to change those obscure game cursors. Never lose your cursor in a heated battle again!<br><br>Great for MOBA, MMO, RPG, ActionRPG, and any mouse based games. Also works with Windows and normal apps.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Boost visibility</h2>Make those tiny cursors large and colorful.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1283970/extras/c297f194cf9bb65d32eaea658b040e27.poster.avif?t=1770695910\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1283970/extras/c297f194cf9bb65d32eaea658b040e27.webm?t=1770695910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1283970/extras/c297f194cf9bb65d32eaea658b040e27.mp4?t=1770695910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Keep the theme</h2>... or just make the original ones large and glowy.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1283970/extras/d00cb916c6d8c3a230000c126e1836da.poster.avif?t=1770695910\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1283970/extras/d00cb916c6d8c3a230000c126e1836da.webm?t=1770695910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1283970/extras/d00cb916c6d8c3a230000c126e1836da.mp4?t=1770695910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Add effects</h2>Effects like zoom, cross, and halo add extra visibilty. Great for games and apps.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1283970/extras/a315152524545e0a93b4bd5427b2a1cc.poster.avif?t=1770695910\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1283970/extras/a315152524545e0a93b4bd5427b2a1cc.webm?t=1770695910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1283970/extras/a315152524545e0a93b4bd5427b2a1cc.mp4?t=1770695910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Add style</h2>Some next level cursor options... with jiggle physics!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1283970/extras/ff2c8d458f99cd30f0875f97bc86bc28.poster.avif?t=1770695910\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1283970/extras/ff2c8d458f99cd30f0875f97bc86bc28.webm?t=1770695910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1283970/extras/ff2c8d458f99cd30f0875f97bc86bc28.mp4?t=1770695910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Includes 26 basic cursors and 4 3D overlay cursors<br></li><li>Many more cursors found on Steam Workshop<br></li><li>Many colors, including inverted color.<br></li><li>Adjustable sizes<br></li><li>Effects including Zoom, Scope, Halo, Glow, and Mirror.<br></li><li>Works with any game, Windows, and most apps.<br></li><li>Preset support<br></li><li>Cursor editor<br></li><li>Code signed for security and anticheat support<br></li><li>Multimonitor support<br></li><li>No impact on performance<br></li><li>Jiggle physics!</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Instructions</h2>Locate a game cursor you wish to change and hit <strong>CTRL ALT C</strong> to open a cursor selection UI. Use this to change the cursor, size, and color.<br><strong>TIP:</strong> To make all cursors visible quickly, choose the special &quot;default&quot; cursor and increase the size or add glow.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Not a cheat</h2>Yolomouse works similar to other accessibility tools. It is not a cheat and doesn't change the game or app. It is also routinely playtested against major titles to verify safety. However, its still important to verify it does not violate your game's ToS before use.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1283970?t=1770695910","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1283970/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770695910","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1283970/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770695910","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1283970/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770695910","categories":[{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"Use YoloMouse to change those obscure game cursors. Never lose your cursor in a heated battle again!<br><br>Great for MOBA, MMO, RPG, ActionRPG, and any mouse based games. Also works with Windows and normal apps.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Boost visibility</h2>Make those tiny cursors large and colorful.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1283970/extras/c297f194cf9bb65d32eaea658b040e27.poster.avif?t=1770695910\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1283