as/ff2c8d458f99cd30f0875f97bc86bc28.poster.avif?t=1770695910\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1283970/extras/ff2c8d458f99cd30f0875f97bc86bc28.webm?t=1770695910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1283970/extras/ff2c8d458f99cd30f0875f97bc86bc28.mp4?t=1770695910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Includes 26 basic cursors and 4 3D overlay cursors<br></li><li>Many more cursors found on Steam Workshop<br></li><li>Many colors, including inverted color.<br></li><li>Adjustable sizes<br></li><li>Effects including Zoom, Scope, Halo, Glow, and Mirror.<br></li><li>Works with any game, Windows, and most apps.<br></li><li>Preset support<br></li><li>Cursor editor<br></li><li>Code signed for security and anticheat support<br></li><li>Multimonitor support<br></li><li>No impact on performance<br></li><li>Jiggle physics!</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Instructions</h2>Locate a game cursor you wish to change and hit <strong>CTRL ALT C</strong> to open a cursor selection UI. Use this to change the cursor, size, and color.<br><strong>TIP:</strong> To make all cursors visible quickly, choose the special &quot;default&quot; cursor and increase the size or add glow.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Not a cheat</h2>Yolomouse works similar to other accessibility tools. It is not a cheat and doesn't change the game or app. It is also routinely playtested against major titles to verify safety. However, its still important to verify it does not violate your game's ToS before use.","developers":["Dragonrise Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Animation & Modeling","id":"51"},{"description":"Design & Illustration","id":"53"},{"description":"Education","id":"54"},{"description":"Photo Editing","id":"55"},{"description":"Software Training